<title>POLAND: Polish NBP sells PLN 400 mln 182-day bills.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP sells PLN 400 mln 182-day bills.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland sold 400 million zlotys of 182-day NBP-bills after Polish banks bid for 533 million with the central bank, the NBP said.</p>
<p>The average yield of the bills held flat at 22.00 percent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
